{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23833","headline":"戊申岁暮咏怀三首 一 · 白居易","name":"戊申岁暮咏怀三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穷冬月末两三日，半百年过六七时。\n龙尾趂朝无气力，牛头参道有心期。\n荣华外物终须悟，老病傍人岂得知。\n犹被妻儿教渐退，莫求致仕且分司。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}